  "status": "Delivered area-specific interface and cream-wave preview; local APK and Drive metadata checks pass. Physical-phone acceptance remains open.",
  "changes": [
    "Gelato and Crystal each use a complete independent fourteen-role UI atlas, removing the Bakery texture merge/fallback.",
    "Gelato uses lavender/mint ceramic; Crystal uses pale aqua sugar glass with peach/copper accents. Existing area menu frames remain integrated.",
    "Each area selects its own subtle cream-wave painting. Timing, white opaque coverage, route choices and Reduced Motion remain established. Bakery retains its original controls and neutral wave.",
    "New panel source slices keep HUD, result and upgrade-card text within quiet faces. Crystal selector crest padding preserves live text and hit rectangles.",
    "Gameplay JSON data, save formats, earned gates, purchase behavior, audio and the approved single-pulse startup are preserved."
  ],
  "update_compatibility": "Same preview package and development signing certificate as v0.7.10. Version code 36 increases to 38 after public code 37; public artifacts remain unchanged. Ten gameplay JSONs remain byte-identical. Install-over save retention requires phone verification.",
